{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>פן תורש</b> Two times in the Masorah: here and the other: אל תאהב שנה פן תורש. That which the verse says, וקרעים תלביש נומה, teaches you: whoever sleeps in the house of study, his Torah becomes torn in pieces, and this is: אל תאהב שנה בבית המדרש פן תורש — lest you be impoverished of your learning. So too Joseph said to Jacob: better that you come here, even to go outside the land, פן תורש מתורה — lest you be impoverished of Torah, for you will not be able to study there because of the famine."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 45, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:24.660102059Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}